    "notes": "Single session, July 14, 1966 at Van Gelder Studio, Englewood Cliffs. First meeting of Hutcherson and McCoy Tyner. Joe Henderson absent from track 3 (Summer Nights). All compositions by Bobby Hutcherson except Una Muy Bonita (Ornette Coleman). Released March 1968."
